{
  "_file": "damned_waters/game/data/rooms/rondvaartboot.json \u2014 RoomSpec for Rondvaart 14 (the city, district 6: Damrak): a glass-roofed tour boat tied up at its pier on the Damrak basin, the water high under it: the gangway, the saloon's rows of seats with the life jackets on them, the skipper's console at the bow. Its lights are on. It was the last trip of the night. Modelled after openly licensed photographs; every business name is made up, the landmarks keep theirs. The power is still on; nobody is there. Outdoor (street.py, city.py and landmarks.py build it). Single source of truth for Blender (render) and the engine (collision, cameras, things).",
